 <section className="reaction-focus" aria-label="Connected reaction focus"><label>REACTION FOCUS<select aria-label="Reaction focus" disabled={loading||Boolean(error)} value={reaction} onChange={e=>selectReaction(e.target.value)}><option value="">All reactions</option>{reaction&&!reactionChoices(data).includes(reaction)&&<option value={reaction}>{titleCase(reaction)} · saved focus</option>}{reactionChoices(data).map(term=><option key={term} value={term}>{titleCase(term)}</option>)}</select></label>{reaction&&<><button id="evidence-trigger" className="btn small evidence-trigger" aria-controls="evidence-drawer" aria-expanded={evidenceOpen} onClick={()=>setEvidenceOpen(true)}><ScanLine size={14}/> Open evidence</button><nav aria-label="Follow selected reaction">{[['reports','Case reports'],['signals','Signal evidence'],['network','Network']].map(([id,label])=><button key={id} aria-current={view===id?'page':undefined} onClick={()=>navigate(id)}>{label} <ArrowUpRight size={12}/></button>)}<button onClick={()=>selectReaction('')}>Clear focus <X size={12}/></button></nav><p>Following {titleCase(reaction)} across tabs. Reports use a reaction-specific query; cohort charts and signal denominators stay unchanged.</p></>}{!reaction&&<p>Select a reaction in a chart, table, or network to follow its evidence across tabs.</p>}</section>
